                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I set ZEPPELIN_SERVER_CONTEXT_PATH is /zeppelin/&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;and this is what happen after I do that.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://camo.githubusercontent.com/586205cd96d380676754968157d0fe78fafdc78b/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f444531556769782e6a7067&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

