                            <comment id="15704049" author="giaosuddau" created="Tue, 29 Nov 2016 03:32:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;From the library MathJax the path of jax and extensions seem to be fixed to root directory.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-javascript&quot;&gt;    id: &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Jax&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,
    version: &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;2.7.0&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,
    directory: ROOT+&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;/jax&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,
    extensionDir: ROOT+&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;/extensions&quot;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15704205" author="giaosuddau" created="Tue, 29 Nov 2016 05:02:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Continuing to investigate&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
