    &amp;lt;/script&amp;gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any ideas how to make this  var url = &quot;http://localhost:8080/zeppelin&quot; dynamic?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
